Studio Trainer
A local LoRA / full fine-tune trainer for the Anima 2B image model.

This project is a fork of Anima TrainFlow, originally created by ThetaCursed
(https://github.com/ThetaCursed/Anima-TrainFlow) and distributed under the MIT
License. The original copyright and MIT license terms are retained in LICENSE.

Credit for the original Anima TrainFlow application and its training engine
goes to ThetaCursed. This fork (ToxicHost/Anima-TrainFlow-TH) adds block-swap
exposure, caption tag-pruning, a full fine-tune toggle, an in-app updater, a
layered preset system, and a FastAPI + offline frontend rebuild of the UI.
